loads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-10-at-15.34.27-2-1024x576.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5770\\"/></figure>\\n<!-- /wp:image -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:image {\\"id\\":5774,\\"sizeSlug\\":\\"large\\",\\"linkDestination\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><img src=\\"https://sitrobbani.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-10-at-15.34.28-1-1-1024x576.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5774\\"/></figure>\\n<!-- /wp:image -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:image {\\"id\\":5775,\\"sizeSlug\\":\\"large\\",\\"linkDestination\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><img src=\\"https://sitrobbani.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-10-at-15.34.28-2-1-1024x576.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5775\\"/></figure>\\n<!-- /wp:image -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:image {\\"id\\":5776,\\"sizeSlug\\":\\"large\\",\\"linkDestination\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><img src=\\"https://sitrobbani.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-10-at-15.34.28-3-1024x576.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5776\\"/></figure>\\n<!-- /wp:image -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:image {\\"id\\":5769,\\"sizeSlug\\":\\"large\\",\\"linkDestination\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><img src=\\"https://sitrobbani.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-10-at-15.34.29-1-1-1024x576.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5769\\"/></figure>\\n<!-- /wp:image -->"\n    },\n    {\n        "title": "Kegiatan Visitasi Audit Mutu Internal (AMI) SMPIT Robbani Ogan Ilir",\n        "slug": "amismp",\n        "category": "Berita SMPIT",\n        "unit": "smpit",\n        "unit_name": "SMPIT Robbani",\n        "is_article": false,\n        "date": "11 October 2023",\n        "timestamp": 1697019018,\n        "raw_date": "2023-10-11 10:10:18",\n        "author": "Admin SIT Robbani",\n        "image": "/uploads/wp_assets/5bb769e0c3b8e0d28d23cc472856c437.webp",\n        "excerpt": "\\nOgan Ilir, 03 Oktober 2023 \\u2013 Yayasan Generasi Robbani Sumatera Selatan (Sumsel) melakukan salah satu kegiatan penjamin mutu sekolah, yaitu Audit Mutu Internal(...",\n        "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Ogan Ilir, 03 Oktober 2023 \\u2013 Yayasan Generasi Robbani Sumatera Selatan (Sumsel) melakukan salah satu kegiatan penjamin mutu sekolah, yaitu Audit Mutu Internal(AMI) di SMPIT Robbani Ogan Ilir. Kegiatan ini dikomandoi oleh Tim Penjamin Mutu SIT Robbani yang dikomandoi oleh Bapak Ir Kemas Moh Ade Isnaeni, S.T, M.T, dengan dia anggota Bapak Septa Ryan Hidayat, dan Ibu Sughesti Wulandari.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Kegiatan ini dilakukan untuk menilai secara internal mutu sekolah berdasarkan standar Akreditasi BAN-SM, dimana outputnya adalah sekolah menjadi siap untuk di akreditasi oleh pihak eksternal yg berkompeten dan mampu mencapai poin tertinggi 4 standar(standar mutu, standar proses pembelajaran, standar mutu guru dan standar manajemen sekolah) yg ditetapkan oleh BAN-SM<br>Akreditasi mutu internal SMPIT Robbani Ogan Ilir diketuai oleh Kemas Moh Ade Isnaeni, S.T, M.T, dan dua anggotanya yaitu Sughesti Wulandari, S.Pd dan Septa Ryan Hidayat.</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p></p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Berikut beberapa dokumentasi kegiatannya:</p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p></p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p></p>\\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\\n\\n<!-- wp:gallery {\\"linkTo\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\\"><!-- wp:image {\\"id\\":5704,\\"sizeSlug\\":\\"large\\",\\"linkDestination\\":\\"none\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\"wp-block-image size-large\\"><img src=\\"https://sitrobbani.sch.id/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/WhatsApp-Image-2023-10-03-at-18.36.20-1024x461.jpeg\\" alt=\\"\\" class=\\"wp-image-5704\\"/></figure>\\n<!-